### Chi co tren VPS Linux (khong dua vao git) ###
/log/
/backup/
/.ssh/
*.out
# AdminChat.txt truoc day duoc theo doi (co dong "!AdminChat.txt" mien tru). Da bo:
# server GHI TIEP vao file nay moi khi admin chat, nen no lam "git status" tren VPS
# dirty va deploy-auto.sh TU CHOI git pull. Ban cu con o /root/kpah-backup tren VPS.
AdminChat*.txt
# File server tu sinh, dat ten theo IP ket noi (vd 42.119.73.152.txt) - khong phai
# code, lam "git status" tren VPS bi dirty va chan deploy-auto.sh neu khong bo qua.
# IP luon bat dau bang chu so nen loc theo dau ten file, chi ap dung o thu muc goc.
/[0-9]*.txt

### Bi mat rieng cua tung may chu web (DB pass, tai khoan ngan hang, API key...) ###
# Sua tay web/config.php truc tiep tren VPS se lam git status "dirty" va chan
# deploy-auto.sh (no kiem tra "git status --porcelain" phai sach truoc khi pull).
# Dung web/config.local.php thay vi sua config.php - xem web/config.local.php.example.
web/config.local.php
# Ban sao luu / file tam khi sua config: de trong repo la "git status" thanh dirty
# va deploy-auto.sh TU CHOI git pull o lan deploy ke tiep. Da vap dung cai nay
# ngay 29/08/2026 - ca file .swp cua nano lan file .bak deu chan deploy.
web/config.local.php.bak*
web/.config.local.php.sw?
# Chan CHUNG cho moi file tam cua trinh soan thao, o bat ky dau trong repo. Hai dong
# tren chi chan dung mot duong dan, nen ngay 30/08/2026 lai vap tiep: nano mo
# /opt/kpah/server.ini sinh ra /opt/kpah/.server.ini.swp va deploy dung lai.
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.*.sw?

